/E ( Added more detailed login/register steps, the extension download process, onboarding with a demo and customization options, search and highlight features, improved graphics, colour-coded bias indicators, and guidance pop-ups. This version was used in a second round of user testing.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
