<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 335 0 R
/E (The main catalyst for all the prototype iterations were the feedback and results from our user testing processes. We continued doing walkthroughs to test how efficient each feature and overall experience was. We used affinity mapping and thematic analysis to identify key areas of focus, especially clarity, navigation, and simplicity. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
