/S /P
/P 338 0 R
/E (     In regards to the service blueprint, we created a very simple and easy to understand visual, with labelled sections such as the user actions, front stage and backstage, as well as the line of interaction and line of visibility. Being a browser extension we acknowledge that there are considerably less touch points in comparison to a traditional business such as Amazon or a grocery store. Considering this, we attempted to identify each and every user action and associated stage in the user journey. These sections were broken up into 5 key stages: Awareness, Consideration, Discovery, Usage and Loyalty, each covering their own user actions.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
