/E (     In regards to the support processes shown in the Service Blueprint, there are a few supporting features. Primarily it would be the behind the scenes done by our team, completing tasks such as monitoring user traffic and usage, updating advertisements and SEO ranking to stay relevant and maintain growth, alongside maintenance of the physical server. Other than these, simple background tasks carried out by the extension and the back end server are managed and processed, such as payments and user information and preferences stored locally in the extension on the users browser.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
