456 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 340 0 R
/E (     All prototyping for our solution was done using Figma. Since we were designing a browser extension, digital prototyping allowed us to better visualize interactive elements in context. We began with a few paper sketches to map the user journey \(Appendix pg. 24\), then transitioned to Figma to create low- to high-fidelity prototypes. This shift allowed us to explore layout, interactivity, and navigation flow more effectively, particularly how features would appear and behave in a real browser environment.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
