458 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 340 0 R
/E (     We also emphasized key visual elements such as our logo \(Appendix pg. 28\) to improve visuals and emphasize the presence of the solution in a natural browsing experience. Our bias detector was enhanced with an improved scale to offer more specific insights, and we reorganized content panels to prioritize readability and reduce cognitive load \(Appendix pg. 28\).)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
